---
import { Activity, ArrowLeft, ArrowUpRight, Moon, Radio, Sparkles, Sun } from "@lucide/astro";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { brandAssets } from "../config/brand-assets";
import "../styles/xiaoyugan.css";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="小鱼干｜蕾姆触摸实验室"
  description="小鱼的高动态视觉实验室：点击蕾姆猫耳，留下匿名摸摸记录，体验蓝白清透的交互材质。"
  noindex
  hideChrome
>
  <div class="xyg-page" data-xiaoyugan>
    <div class="xyg-atmosphere" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="xyg-orbit xyg-orbit--one"></span>
      <span class="xyg-orbit xyg-orbit--two"></span>
      <span class="xyg-atmosphere__glow"></span>
      <span class="xyg-atmosphere__grain"></span>
    </div>

    <header class="xyg-nav xyg-glass">
      <a class="xyg-brand" href="/" aria-label="返回小鱼首页">
        <img class="xyg-brand__mark" src={brandAssets.navigation} width="32" height="32" alt="" aria-hidden="true" decoding="async" draggable="false" />
        <span><strong>小鱼干</strong><small>REMOVO LAB</small></span>
      </a>
      <nav aria-label="实验室导航">
        <a class="xyg-back" href="/"><ArrowLeft size={16} stroke-width={1.8} aria-hidden="true" /><span>主站</span></a>
        <button class="xyg-theme" type="button" data-theme-toggle aria-label="切换网站外观">
          <Moon class="theme-icon--moon" size={18} stroke-width={1.8} aria-hidden="true" />
          <Sun class="theme-icon--sun" size={18} stroke-width={1.8} aria-hidden="true" />
        </button>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="xyg-shell">
      <section class="xyg-intro" aria-labelledby="xyg-title">
        <p class="xyg-kicker"><span></span> XIAOYUGAN / INTERACTION LAB 01</p>
        <h1 id="xyg-title">先摸一下，<br /><em>再认识这个界面。</em></h1>
        <div class="xyg-intro__footer">
          <p>这里用来测试更大胆的材质与动态。第一个实验，是会记住每一次触碰的蕾姆猫耳。</p>
          <span><Radio size={14} aria-hidden="true" /> LIVE EXPERIMENT</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <article class="xyg-pet-card xyg-glass" data-pet-card data-tilt data-xyg-reveal aria-labelledby="pet-title">
        <div class="xyg-card-shine" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <header class="xyg-card-header">
          <div><span>EXPERIMENT 01</span><strong id="pet-title">蕾姆猫耳 · Touch Counter</strong></div>
          <span class="xyg-live"><i></i> LIVE</span>
        </header>

        <div class="xyg-pet-card__body">
          <div class="xyg-pet-copy">
            <p class="xyg-pet-copy__index">REM / CAT EAR / 001</p>
            <h2>猫耳会回应，<br /><span>也会记住你。</span></h2>
            <p>轻点猫耳，每一次摸摸都会获得即时反馈，并以匿名方式进入全站记录。</p>
            <div class="xyg-own-record">
              <div><span data-own-count>0</span><small>你的摸摸</small></div>
              <p><span data-visitor-label>正在生成匿名身份</span><small>只保存在当前浏览器，不采集个人资料</small></p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <button class="xyg-rem-touch" type="button" data-pet-button aria-label="摸一下蕾姆猫耳">
            <span class="xyg-rem-touch__aura" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="xyg-rem-touch__rings" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
            <span class="xyg-rem-character" aria-hidden="true">
              <img class="xyg-rem-face" data-rem-artwork src={brandAssets.pwa512} width="512" height="512" alt="" draggable="false" />
            </span>
            <span class="xyg-rem-touch__label"><strong>点一下猫耳</strong><small>TAP TO PET</small></span>
          </button>
        </div>

        <footer class="xyg-pet-card__footer">
          <span data-connection data-state="loading"><i></i>正在连接记录</span>
          <p>点击反馈 · 匿名计数 · 本地兜底</p>
        </footer>
        <p class="xyg-sr-only" aria-live="polite" data-pet-announcement></p>
      </article>

      <section class="xyg-bloom" aria-labelledby="bloom-title">
        <header class="xyg-section-heading" data-xyg-reveal>
          <div><p class="xyg-kicker"><span></span> PARTICLE BLOOM</p><h2 id="bloom-title">让一束光，<br /><em>长成会呼吸的花。</em></h2></div>
          <p>第二个实验把蓝白粒子聚成一朵花。移动指针改变观看角度，轻点让它散开，再看它带着一点弹性回到原位。</p>
        </header>

        <article class="xyg-bloom-card xyg-glass" data-particle-bloom data-xyg-reveal aria-labelledby="bloom-card-title">
          <header class="xyg-card-header">
            <div><span>EXPERIMENT 02</span><strong id="bloom-card-title">粒子花园 · REMOVO Particle Bloom</strong></div>
            <div class="xyg-bloom-card__tools">
              <span class="xyg-live"><i></i><span data-bloom-status>GPU READY</span></span>
              <button type="button" data-bloom-immersive aria-pressed="false" aria-label="进入粒子花园沉浸模式">沉浸模式</button>
            </div>
          </header>

          <div class="xyg-bloom-card__body">
            <div class="xyg-bloom-copy">
              <p class="xyg-pet-copy__index">BLOOM / PARTICLE / 002</p>
              <h3>不是播放视频，<br /><span>每一粒都在实时生长。</span></h3>
              <p>粒子由浏览器即时计算，没有预渲染素材。它会根据设备能力自动调整密度，离开画面后也会安静停下。</p>
              <ul aria-label="粒子实验特性">
                <li>指针视差</li><li>点击散开</li><li>自适应性能</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <button class="xyg-bloom-stage" type="button" data-bloom-trigger aria-label="让粒子花散开并重新聚合">
              <canvas data-bloom-canvas aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
              <span class="xyg-bloom-fallback" data-bloom-fallback aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><b></b></span>
              <span class="xyg-bloom-orbit" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span>
              <span class="xyg-bloom-stage__label"><strong>轻点散开</strong><small>TAP TO SCATTER</small></span>
            </button>
          </div>

          <footer class="xyg-bloom-card__footer">
            <span>REAL-TIME WEBGL / BLUE-WHITE STUDY</span>
            <p>桌面端高密度 · 手机端自动减量 · 支持减少动态</p>
          </footer>
          <button class="xyg-bloom-close" type="button" data-bloom-close aria-label="退出粒子花园沉浸模式">退出沉浸</button>
          <p class="xyg-sr-only" aria-live="polite" data-bloom-announcement></p>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section class="xyg-records" aria-labelledby="records-title">
        <header class="xyg-section-heading" data-xyg-reveal>
          <div><p class="xyg-kicker"><span></span> TOUCH RECORD</p><h2 id="records-title">每一次点击，<br /><em>都会留下轻轻的回声。</em></h2></div>
          <p>这是匿名互动记录，计数数据不写入姓名、邮箱、IP 或设备指纹。换一个浏览器，会成为另一条匿名记录。</p>
        </header>

        <div class="xyg-metrics" data-xyg-reveal>
          <article class="xyg-metric xyg-glass"><small>MY TOUCHES</small><strong data-own-count>0</strong><span>你的次数</span></article>
          <article class="xyg-metric xyg-glass"><small>ALL TOUCHES</small><strong data-total-count>0</strong><span>全站摸摸</span></article>
          <article class="xyg-metric xyg-glass"><small>VISITORS</small><strong data-participant-count>0</strong><span>匿名参与者</span></article>
        </div>

        <div class="xyg-ledger-grid">
          <article class="xyg-ledger xyg-glass" data-xyg-reveal data-tilt>
            <header><div><Sparkles size={17} aria-hidden="true" /><span>匿名摸摸榜</span></div><small>GLOBAL / TOP 06</small></header>
            <ol data-leaderboard><li><span>01</span><strong>正在读取全站记录</strong><em>···</em></li></ol>
          </article>
          <article class="xyg-ledger xyg-ledger--recent xyg-glass" data-xyg-reveal data-tilt>
            <header><div><Activity size={17} aria-hidden="true" /><span>这次的触碰</span></div><small>LOCAL / RECENT</small></header>
            <ol data-recent-pets><li class="is-empty">点一下猫耳，这里会留下当前会话的时间记录。</li></ol>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="xyg-next" aria-labelledby="next-title">
        <header class="xyg-section-heading" data-xyg-reveal>
          <div><p class="xyg-kicker"><span></span> NEXT STUDIES</p><h2 id="next-title">更多东西，<br /><em>正在这里慢慢长出来。</em></h2></div>
          <p>成熟的实验以后会回到主站；这里保留过程、触感和还没有被命名的想法。</p>
        </header>
        <div class="xyg-next-grid">
          <article class="xyg-next-card xyg-glass" data-xyg-reveal data-tilt><small>03 / MATERIAL</small><div class="xyg-liquid-demo" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><i></i></div><h3>会追光的玻璃</h3><p>让边缘回应指针，不让内容被效果吞掉。</p><span>IN PROGRESS</span></article>
          <article class="xyg-next-card xyg-glass" data-xyg-reveal data-tilt><small>04 / MOTION</small><div class="xyg-orbit-demo" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><i></i><b></b></div><h3>有重量的动效</h3><p>每个动作都有起因、惯性与安静停下的时刻。</p><span>OPEN STUDY</span></article>
          <article class="xyg-next-card xyg-next-card--wide xyg-glass" data-xyg-reveal data-tilt><small>05 / REMOVO</small><div class="xyg-wave-demo" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><h3>把小鱼、蕾姆灵感与代码，做成同一种语言。</h3><p>不是模板站，是一个会持续生长的个人空间。</p><span>CONTINUE</span></article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <footer class="xyg-footer" data-xyg-reveal>
        <div><p class="xyg-kicker"><span></span> REMOVO / XIAOYUGAN</p><h2>实验先留在这里，<br /><em>好东西再带回主站。</em></h2></div>
        <a class="xyg-glass" href="/">回到小鱼的个人网站 <ArrowUpRight size={17} aria-hidden="true" /></a>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  import "../scripts/xiaoyugan-lab";
  import "../scripts/particle-bloom";
</script>
